    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Instant action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a new run in a few seconds and get ready for intense post-apo warafare !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a simple rifle filled with ammo and 100 health points and face you frist enemy very quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you clear a level :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you loot a new weapon (you can skip or equip)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you gain money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you choose a stat upgrade</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next level is harder : more ennemies, more life points, more danger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot, loot, loot !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rifles, guns, shotguns, flamme throwers and more.. each in 5 levels of quality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be fast, be accurate, don't loose health points : the loot will be generous !</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spend the earned money in powerfull capacities..</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the classic automatic turret to the artillery barrage request, spend the money you earn to help make the difference in the battlefiled !</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>.. or keep it for your next run !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like any good roguelike, you won't start from scratch every time : improve your stats, unlock lootable weapons and abilities !</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do it solo.. or squad with friends !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is quite challenging on solo mode, but it becomes even more in coop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a run with friends and\u00a0test the limits of your friendship.. because the loot is unique ! More of that : the money is shared in the squad !<br>Feel like trolling ? Blow all the hard-earned squad money on the last enemy in a devastating and completely useless nuke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Instant action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a new run in a few seconds and get ready for intense post-apo warafare !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a simple rifle filled with ammo and 100 health points and face you frist enemy very quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you clear a level :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you loot a new weapon (you can skip or equip)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you gain money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you choose a stat upgrade</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next level is harder : more ennemies, more life points, more danger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot, loot, loot !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rifles, guns, shotguns, flamme throwers and more.. each in 5 levels of quality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be fast, be accurate, don't loose health points : the loot will be generous !</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spend the earned money in powerfull capacities..</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the classic automatic turret to the artillery barrage request, spend the money you earn to help make the difference in the battlefiled !</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>.. or keep it for your next run !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like any good roguelike, you won't start from scratch every time : improve your stats, unlock lootable weapons and abilities !</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do it solo.. or squad with friends !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is quite challenging on solo mode, but it becomes even more in coop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a run with friends and\u00a0test the limits of your friendship.. because the loot is unique ! More of that : the money is shared in the squad !<br>Feel like trolling ? Blow all the hard-earned squad money on the last enemy in a devastating and completely useless nuke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "short_description": "A fast-paced and intense roguelike shooter in a ravaged world !In this low-poly third person shooter in a brutal post-apocalyptic universe, complete levels solo or in co-op, loot patched-up weapons, choose your upgrades and spend your money wisely on abilities that will make the difference !",
